CoStage Community Edition — distribution repository / 社区版分发仓库
Copyright (c) 2026 CoStage authors

1. FREE BINARY DISTRIBUTION / 免费二进制发行版
   This repository publishes COMPILED ARTIFACTS and documentation only — it contains no source code.
   The binaries are free to download and use. 本仓仅发布编译产物与文档，不含源码；二进制免费使用。

2. SOURCE CODE / 源码
   The complete engineering source is licensed under the MIT License and is delivered to SUBSCRIBERS
   through a private repository (read-only access), together with commit history, build scripts, tests
   and design documents. 完整工程源码以 MIT 许可发布，仅对订阅用户通过私有仓库（只读）提供。

3. REDISTRIBUTION / 再分发
   You may redistribute these binaries, provided that you keep LICENSE, NOTICE, THIRD-PARTY.md and the
   third-party/ licence texts intact, do not remove attributions, and do not imply official origin or
   endorsement (see TRADEMARKS.md). 再分发须保留上述文件与署名，且不得暗示官方来源或背书。

4. THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS / 第三方组件
   LiveKit server — Apache-2.0 (upstream NOTICE reproduced in third-party/NOTICE.livekit.txt);
   ZLMediaKit (MediaServer) — MIT; HashiCorp libraries — MPL-2.0 (source pointers in
   third-party/MPL-2.0-sources.txt); tldraw whiteboard engine — tldraw license, which is NOT open source
   and requires a commercial licence for production use.
   ⚠ Releases up to and including v0.2.2 include tldraw; 未经 tldraw Inc. 商业许可不得用于生产环境。

5. NOT OPEN SOURCE / 非开源
   Neither this repository nor the project is open source: the source is not publicly distributed, which
   does not meet the OSI definition. Do not describe them as "open source". Correct wording: a free binary
   distribution whose MIT-licensed source is available to subscribers.
   本仓与项目均非开源（源码不公开分发，不满足 OSI 定义），不得以「开源」宣传。

6. NO WARRANTY
   Artifacts are provided "AS IS", without warranty of any kind, as set out in the MIT License.
